cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Standard Astro in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Standard Astro"
type: software
authors:
  - alias: MikhailXiaomaikou
abstract: >-
  An auditable AI research workbench for observational cosmology. Numerical
  claims must trace to current-run server evidence, versioned data with
  pinned checksums, provenance records, and real citations; insufficient
  evidence returns WITHHELD or CAPABILITY_GAP instead of a guess.
repository-code: "https://github.com/MikhailXiaomaikou/Standard-Astro"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - cosmology
  - provenance
  - reproducibility
  - anti-fabrication
  - llm-agent
